OL,3,AMan dies after tiger attack at wildlife
OL,4,Apark
OL,5,
OL,6,FA park spokesperson said: "We are
OL,7,Fdeeply saddened by today's tragic
OL,8,Fincident. Our thoughts and heartfelt
OL,9,Fsympathies are with the family and
OL,10,Floved ones of the person who has lost
OL,11,Ftheir life."
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
