OL,3,AVolunteer police chief fired after
OL,4,APalantir probe
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Metropolitan Police has fired the
OL,7,Fhead of its Special Constabulary after
OL,8,FPalantir's AI monitoring uncovered that
OL,9,Fhe had used his work phone to copy
OL,10,Fintimate images of a woman.
OL,12,FSpecial chief officer James Deller, who
OL,13,Fled the force's volunteer officers, was
OL,14,Fdismissed following a misconduct
OL,15,Fhearing on Friday.
OL,17,FThe Met said investigators used lawful
OL,18,Fbusiness monitoring and Palantir's
OL,19,FFoundry system, which uses artificial
OL,20,Fintelligence (AI), to find the
OL,21,Fmisconduct by Deller.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
