OL,3,AGreen Party MP wants to make sure it is
OL,4,A'not vulnerable to extremists'
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt comes after ex-leader Caroline Lucas
OL,7,Fsaid it was not being protected from
OL,8,Fentryism - where people sign up to a
OL,9,Fparty to try to change it.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
