OL,4,ASaudi capital Riyadh
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe US embassy said it was "aware of
OL,7,Fattacks on King Khalid International
OL,8,FAirport" and urged American citizens to
OL,9,Favoid the airport and surrounding
OL,10,Fareas.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
